// jpArmPins: the DISTRIBUTED divergences the seam table found, recorded per
// arm as measured (identical at base 83cd4a93; filing candidate FC-JP-1,
// `distributed`). An OUTER-join chain whose second arm is keyed on the first
// (`… LEFT JOIN jp_i a ON a.oid = o.k AND <filter> LEFT JOIN jp_i b ON b.oid =
// a.oid AND <filter>`), where the outer key's name (`k`) is one no item
